  "Drive ID (advanced — a specific/shared drive)": "Drive ID（上級——特定/共有ドライブ）",
  "Custom OAuth client ID (optional — own Azure app)": "カスタム OAuth client ID（任意——自分の Azure アプリ）",
  "Connect OneDrive": "OneDrive に接続",
